---

---

<section class="relative py-32 pb-40 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 mb-16">
        <h2 class="heading-zenmaru-32 text-soft-black">プロフィール</h2>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
            <img
                src="/images/top/profile/leaf_left.svg"
                alt=""
                class="relative -top-7 w-32 opacity-80"
            />
            <p class="body-14-regular text-soft-black">PROFILE</p>
            <img
                src="/images/top/profile/leaf_right.svg"
                alt=""
                class="relative -top-7 w-32 opacity-80"
            />
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative fade-up about-card">
            <div class="relative w-240 h-100 mx-auto">
                <img
                    src="/images/top/profile/Frame_profile.svg"
                    class="absolute inset-0 w-300 h-100  object-contain"
                />

                <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center px-24">
                    <div class="relative w-70 shrink-0 -translate-y-8">
                        <img
                            src="/images/global/pin.svg"
                            class="absolute -top-2 left-[42%] -translate-x-1/2 w-5 z-20"
                        />

                        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-5 rotate-[-8deg] flex flex-col items-center" >
                            <img
                                src="/images/nakayama/prof.png"
                                class="rounded-md w-full object-cover rotate-6"
                            />

                            <p class="heading-jiyucho-20 text-turquoise-blue-500 mt-4 text-center">
                                これも仕事です！
                            </p>

                            <div class="border-b-2 border-dashed border-[#9CC5C1] mt-3"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex-1 ml-16">
                        <div class="flex items-end gap-6 mb-2">
                            <h3 class="heading-zenmaru-32 text-gray-800">
                                中山奈々
                            </h3>

                            <span class="body-16-medium text-gray-800">
                                なかやま なな
                            </span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="h-1.5 w-52 bg-mustard-yellow-300 mb-2">
                        </div>

                        <p class="heading-zenmaru-20 text-soft-black leading-12 whitespace-pre-line">
                            わたしは、2001年5月21日生まれ。
                            血液型はB型、星座は双子座です。 MBTIはENFPで、
                            楽しそうなことを見つけると、
                            気づいたらそこにいます！
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
    </div>
</section>
